
-----------------------------
Creating initial conditions
-----------------------------

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
First option: we only want to modify the initial intracellular contents of the organisms because 
the minimum and maximum quotas and ratios have been modified in the parameter file
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1/ Using the existing initial conditions available in the BIBLIOTHEQUE_CINI/CINI_V0 directory, it is
possible to regenerate other initial conditions that will modify the initial intracellular contents 
to make them consistent with the quotas and ratios in the new parameter file.

In this case, you must:
1.a/ copy the new parameter file in the current directory
1.b/ indicate the name of this parameter file and the simulation number in the create_cini_quota.sh file
1.c/ run the create_cini_quota.sh program with the command ./create_cini_quota.sh


-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Second option: you wish to modify all or part of the initial concentrations
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
In this case, you must:
2.a/ indicate the simulation number in the create_cini.sh file
2.b/ run the create_cini.sh program with the command ./create_cini.sh
2.c/ manually edit the values in the new initial conditions directory located in the BIBLIOTHEQUE_CINI directory 
